      "created_at": "2012-12-22T17:12:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello! I've been into this thing for a while, and in my search for more information, I turned my head to Tvtropes.org. If you haven't heard of it, it's a sort of wikipedia for diffrent pop culture icons, such as tv, video games, books, movies, and even tabletop board games. Now Sentinels has its own page, but I find it lacking somewhat. The page seems to have an outline of how to structure it, but the whole page is missing quite a lot, most greviously in what the heros and villians represent.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I call on all the Tropers among you, to help the cause! Honestly, it's with TVtropes that I renewed my love for board games, so I feel it very nessisary to give the Sentinels of the multiverse page the time and care it deserves! Who's with me?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
